@sofiandrade commented on this issue.

Reproduced on the bench rig with 3 devices at a 50 ms poll interval. Frames start dropping once the response queue passes ~400 entries; the poller does not back off, it just keeps stacking reads.

Plan:
- add exponential backoff with a 2 s ceiling when the queue is above the watermark
- log a warning with the device id the first time it happens per hour, not per frame
- PR up tomorrow

